# Copy to compose/.env (not the repo root) on every node: docker compose reads
# .env from the compose file's directory. Only per-host and per-node values
# belong here. Every tuned knob has its default in image/entrypoint.sh, and a
# copy here silently wins over the measured value -- which happened three times
# on 2026-08-27. KNOBS.md lists every knob the entrypoint reads.

# --- required, the same on every node ---------------------------------------
# An image built from this tree (image/build.sh). An older tag carries older
# entrypoint defaults.
IMAGE=spark-glm53:v8
# The head's LAN address. Every rank's mentat agent dials it, the head
# included. It must be the head on every node, not the node itself: see
# "Boot hangs at waiting for 4 GPUs" in the README.
HEAD_HOST=192.0.2.10
# Fabric address prefix, with the trailing dot: the subnet on the ConnectX
# interface each node reaches the others through.
CLUSTER_SUBNET=10.0.0.
# Host paths. Weights must be on each node's local disk: every rank reads the
# whole checkpoint, and an NFS mount races the network at boot.
MODEL_HOST_DIR=/srv/models/glm-5.3-flash-nvfp4
DFLASH_HOST_DIR=/srv/models/glm-5.3-flash-dflash2
EXT_DIR=/srv/ext
CACHE_HOME=/srv/container-cache
LOG_DIR=/srv/logs

# --- required, per node -------------------------------------------------------
# head on one node, worker on the other three.
ROLE=head
# This node's LAN address, the one its mentatd connects from. mentat names a
# node by that address, and the container must use the same one.
VLLM_HOST_IP=192.0.2.10

# --- optional ------------------------------------------------------------------
# One prefix per ConnectX PCIe root for NCCL, space-separated and quoted. Each
# GB10's ConnectX-7 sits on two PCIe roots, and one root tops out near
# 110 Gb/s. Give the second root's interface its own subnet on every node,
# MTU 9000, and list both here: a 126k prefill went from 2,412 to 3,365 tok/s.
# Both roots must land on the same RoCE v2 GID index; the entrypoint refuses
# to start otherwise. Empty = CLUSTER_SUBNET only.
#FABRIC_SUBNETS="10.0.0. 10.0.1."
# Per node. Empty = the interface holding VLLM_HOST_IP.
#NCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME=
# Empty = port form (8002/v1, 8082/mcp). Set a URL only to pin one address.
#MENTAT_MCP_API=
#MENTAT_OPENAI_API=

# --- mentatd (compose/mentatd.yaml reads this same file) ---------------------
# Empty = VLLM_HOST_IP and HEAD_HOST:6379; see compose/mentatd.yaml.
#MENTAT_NODE_IP=
#MENTAT_PEERS=
# Optional interface ranking and fabric tags; see compose/mentatd.yaml before
# setting it.
#MENTAT_ANNOUNCE_IFACES=enP7s7=lan,enp1s0f*np*=connectx+rdma
# Signs the daemons' announcements. Set it on every node or on none, and keep
# it out of git.
#MENTAT_SECRET=
